# The repository root. Every file left in it is fixed there by a tool that
# reads it by that exact path: cargo reads Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock and runs
# build.rs, npm reads package.json and package-lock.json, git reads
# .gitignore, dotenv reads .env.example, the Wisent release tooling reads
# .wisent-release.json and platform-entitlements.json, and the published
# surface check reads released-surface.json. LICENSE, NOTICE and README.md are
# read by people and by every registry this package is published to. Moving
# any of them into a sub-folder breaks the tool that names the path.
.

